CANVAS_BASE_URL=URL_OF_YOUR_CANVAS_INSTANCE (replace with your actual Canvas instance URL, e.g., https://canvas.instructure.com)
CANVAS_TOKEN=CANVAS_TOKEN (replace with your actual token, which you can generate from Canvas's developer API page, witch is accessed from account > settings > approved integrations > new access token If you dont see it, its been disabled by your adinistrator)
TRELLO_KEY=TOKEN_KEY (replace with your actual key, which you can generate from Trello's developer API page) https://trello.com/power-ups/admin
TRELLO_TOKEN=TOKEN_FROM_TRELLO (replace with your actual token, which you can generate from Trello's developer API page) https://trello.com/power-ups/admin
TRELLO_BOARD_ID=ID_OF_YOUR_TRELLO_BOARD (replace with your actual board ID, by going to your trello board and putting .json in the URL and copying the ID from the resulting JSON)